414 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/A 415 0 R/Alt(A flow chart outlines the steps of a pineapple detection and counting system starting with an orthomosaic image. The system breaks the image into smaller 1280 by 1280 pixel pieces, then makes predictions and stores their coordinates. These predictions are aligned back with the original image, and detections are drawn on it. Finally, results are extracted for visualization, which produces both a report and a visual display on a computer screen. The chart shows a clear process from input image to final outputs for analysis and review.\000)/K[2]/S/Figure/P 81 0 R/Pg 13 0 R>>
endobj

