422 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/A 423 0 R/Alt(A flow chart outlines a training process using active learning. It starts with a dataset folder, which goes into a Real-ERSGAN preprocessing step to create an enhanced dataset folder. This enhanced dataset is then used for training. After training, the process moves to result analysis, followed by labeling. A dashed arrow labeled "Active Learning" loops back from labeling to the enhanced dataset, showing that labeling improves the dataset for further training. The chart uses simple black and white boxes and arrows to show the sequence and feedback loop, highlighting how active learning refines the dataset through repeated cycles.\000)/K[9]/S/Figure/P 81 0 R/Pg 13 0 R>>
endobj

